'''Rosary Angel''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Capsule/Gacha]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 8.5 increases health and attack power, gains [[Zombie Killer]] and can [[Weaken]] [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 474
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Rosary Angel
|name2 = Cross Angel
|name3 = Strike Angel
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cross Angel''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Strike Angel''' when obtained from [[Devilish Illusion]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit can be considered a slightly better version of [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Magica Cat]] against her traits. Her range advantage might seem extraordinarily helpful, but it really only amounts to keeping her alive a little longer since she doesn't gain any useful targets over Magica. Additionally, if you have Magica's True Form, Thaumaturge Cat, they will perform much better than her due to their guaranteed Weaken with 100% uptime, leaving this unit's only real use as [[User Rank]] and [[Underground Labyrinth]] fodder.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

